  op(DYNAMIC_SYSTEM_INDEX_2[1..4]), 
  0 =~ op(simplify(subs(op(DYNAMIC_SYSTEM_INDEX_2[1..4]), diff~(INV_1, t))))
]: &lt;%&gt;;</Text-field>
