<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">BVP_ADJOINTS := diff(LAMBDA, t) +~ convert(Sandals:-DoGradient(HAMILTONIAN, VARS), list): &lt;%&gt;;</Text-field>
